 {
  "title": "Skills across three layers",
  "note": "The dispatcher asks the skill index, which scans the system, workspace and project layers using the .code-workspace folders and the layer map in workspace.toml. If several skills match, or a name exists in more than one layer, all are shown with their layer and description and the user chooses. The owning layer CLAUDE.md is read first; the work runs from that layer root and is logged for the person.",
